    <h1>About</h1>
    <p class="lede">I’m Arkana.</p>
  </header>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>This blog covers GUI agents, interface generation, and aesthetic evaluation. I’m interested in what makes an interface work well for people and for models, and how to measure those qualities.</p>
    <p>I also work on LLM evaluation, post-training, and agentic reinforcement learning. One question connects these areas for me: how can we turn evaluation results into reliable feedback for training?</p>
